      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "While I was impressed with the installation of the system, the experience after installation was very disappointing and frustrating. Nowhere in all the advertising from Nickel (or any other local solar company for that matter) was there a statement or even suggestion that there might be an extended wait for grid connection. We ended up waiting well over three months. While the bank was quite happy to demand loan and interest repayments, the electricity company (Country Energy) have to date (6th July 2010) paid us nothing for our investment. Having spent around $20,000 this has had a detrimental effect on our wellbeing.",
